  "changes": {
    "combatManager::GenerateMap": "Restore conditional catapult frames, x-first horizontal coordinate arithmetic with a signed-word parity result, and direct random ground-frame assignment. Retail draws frame, row, column; the inherited cached coordinates consumed row, column, frame. Complete body and ordered references are exact.",
    "game::NewMap": "Restore ultimate-artifact random rolls in the retail order 20,20,30 at both initial and retry sites. Restore town-type-first comparison, existing-class-first rotation sum and spread-first distance comparison. Instructions and ordered reference identities correspond; local stack placement remains non-exact.",
    "game::Overview": "Restore left + spacing * i evaluation at each icon/text coordinate. Local placement remains non-exact; the gText immediate has a different encoded offset within the instruction because the destination stack displacement uses a different width.",
    "hero::Deallocate": "Apply the measured SOURCE/HERO G5 profile and restore current-player-first owner comparisons and old-owner-first cleanup comparison. Complete instruction and reference correspondence except local stack placement.",
    "HeroHandler": "Apply G5 and restore last-hover-first and selected-army-index-first comparisons. Complete instruction and reference correspondence except local stack placement."
  },
